## Pull request draft guidance
- When user asks for a PR draft/summary, follow `.github/pull_request_template.md`.
- Keep text concise, practical, and review-friendly.
- Focus on:
  - why the change exists
  - what changed (high-impact items only)
  - how it was tested
  - risks and rollback notes
- Avoid vague statements; include concrete checks/commands when available.

